<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African Nov gold output rises to 41.68 tonnes.</title>
<headline>S.African Nov gold output rises to 41.68 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold output rose in November to 41,680.7 kg from October's 41,099.7, Chamber of Mines figures show.  </p>
<p>Detailed figures in kilos (ozs in brackets) -</p>
<p> Nov 1996     Oct 1996     Nov 1995    Jan-Nov 96   Jan-Nov 95</p>
<p> 41,680.7     41,099.7     43,385.6    450,624.2    478,003.5</p>
<p>(1.34 mln)   (1.32 mln)   (1.39 mln)  (14.49 mln)  (15.37 mln)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
